    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T17:12:00Z",
    "body": "This is a runner stop, not a red test. The job `gate` of run 45046208671 was on the runner `uma`. The step \"Batch gate tier\" started at 16:52:15Z and has no end time, no result and no log. The job ended at 17:11:12Z. The gate summary has no FAIL row and no STALL row.\n\nBy the rule \"Runner stops\" (AGENTS.md) the run is started again one time (`gh run rerun 45046208671 --failed`, 17:12Z). A second stop of the same step at the same commit counts as a red `main`.\n\nThe commit ef1572114 changes only `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` (PR #3519). The runs of the three commits before it (148a5c832, deb5364ee, 87fb95f29) are in progress.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
