    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T17:33:49Z",
    "body": "Run 45045638947 (commit deb5364ee, PR #3483) is not a red test either. The job `gate` was on the runner `egg`. The steps 01 to 07 are green. Step 08, `debug build: app (--no-run)`, started and gave no more output. The action \"Batch gate tier\" ended on its limit of 45 minutes. No test ran, and the summary has no FAIL row and no STALL row.\n\nTwo facts for the runner work:\n- The app build on `egg` took more than about 40 minutes. This is a cold or slow build, or a stop of the runner.\n- The stall watchdog (15 minutes with no step output) did not end the build step before the limit of the job. Check if the watchdog covers a build step.\n\nThe run is started again one time (`gh run rerun 45045638947 --failed`, 17:35Z). The run of 148a5c832, the commit before it, is green.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
