    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T17:38:25Z",
    "body": "Run 45046106061 (commit 87fb95f29, PR #3363) ended the same way on the runner `cheese`: the build steps 01 to 09 are done, step 10 (`debug build: ui (--no-run)`) was in progress, and the action \"Batch gate tier\" ended on its limit of 45 minutes. No test ran. There is no FAIL row.\n\nThis is a pattern, not three separate runner stops:\n- PR #3363 adds the dependency `wgpu` and the crate `camcraft-gpu`. Each runner must build `app`, `gpu` and `ui` again from a cold state one time.\n- That cold build does not complete in the limit of 45 minutes of the job. Run 45045638947 on `egg` ended in the app build for the same reason (its checkout was older, but its cache was cold also).\n\nThe run is started again one time (17:38Z). A second run on the same runner starts with the build output of the first run, so it can complete. Each runner that did not build the new dependency can still fail one time.\n\nA change of the limit in `.github/workflows/post-merge.yml` is a decision of the maintainer. It is asked in the main session.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
