    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T17:58:52Z",
    "body": "The second attempt of run 45046208671 (commit ef1572114) ended on the same limit, on the runner `skull`: the builds completed, the gate was at step 456 (`app suites: c_axis_live`) of about 1100, and the action \"Batch gate tier\" stopped at 45 minutes. No FAIL row and no STALL row. Each step that ran is green.\n\nI do not start this run a third time. A run of this commit uses the workflow file of this commit, with the limit of 45 minutes.\n\nPR #3536 (merged as 43217a7c4) sets the limit to 75 minutes. The runs of 43217a7c4 and 6e641dac7 are the first runs with the new limit. A green run there closes this issue. A FAIL row there is a red `main`.\n",
